*Heading
** Independent C3D8T finite nonaffine capacity isolation: regular and warped geometry.
** Sixteen disconnected complete elements: eight nodal temperature bases per geometry.
** All displacements and temperatures prescribed; alpha=0, rho=2000, cp=3000, k=1e-20.
** One time increment of 1 s; each element has exactly one corner heated from 300 to 301 K.
